    "name": "Makis Adventure: Level Editor",
    "steam_appid": 3319330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the official (free to use) Level Editor for the 2D Action-Platformer Makis Adventure. Build your own Dungeons / Levels and share them with the Community.<br><br><strong>About me:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Mateo and Im the 22 years old solo-gamedeveloper behind Makis Adventure. I made the Level Editor within 2 months since community asked me to. I hope that you will enjoy building Levels and Im looking forward to play your Levels too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elements in the Level-Editor:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different ground-variants (grass, stone, snow, ice, water etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the 9 enemies which can be found in the main-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Backgrounds (jungle, underwater, sky, dungeon, snow mountains, vulcano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular tools with Shortcuts: Pen, Eraser, Fill Selection, Block-Picker, Clear Selection etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layer system (Background, Ground, Foreground)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big selection of customization-options for your Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and Load your Level locally on your computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and share Levels to the Server</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the official (free to use) Level Editor for the 2D Action-Platformer Makis Adventure. Build your own Dungeons / Levels and share them with the Community.<br><br><strong>About me:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My name is Mateo and Im the 22 years old solo-gamedeveloper behind Makis Adventure. I made the Level Editor within 2 months since community asked me to. I hope that you will enjoy building Levels and Im looking forward to play your Levels too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elements in the Level-Editor:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different ground-variants (grass, stone, snow, ice, water etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the 9 enemies which can be found in the main-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Backgrounds (jungle, underwater, sky, dungeon, snow mountains, vulcano)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular tools with Shortcuts: Pen, Eraser, Fill Selection, Block-Picker, Clear Selection etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layer system (Background, Ground, Foreground)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big selection of customization-options for your Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and Load your Level locally on your computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload and share Levels to the Server</p></li></ul>",
